DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender:BoldFont {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender.h#DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender:BoldFont
    src   "The real bold face of this font. A bold run is drawn from it -- its own outlines and advances -- instead of from this\nfont's face made bolder. Its primary face is rendered into this font's atlas, the way a fallback's is."
    text  "此字体真正的粗体字型。粗体文本段由它绘制——使用其自身的轮廓和步进——而不是由此\n字体字型加粗而成。它的主字型会像回退字型那样渲染到此字体的图集中。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender:BoldItalicFont {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender.h#DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender:BoldItalicFont
    src   "The real bold-italic face of this font. Without it a bold-italic run takes BoldFont and is slanted, or ItalicFont and is emboldened."
    text  "此字体的真实粗斜体字面。如果没有它，粗斜体文本将使用 BoldFont 并倾斜，或使用 ItalicFont 并加粗。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender:bPreferColorEmoji {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender.h#DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender:bPreferColorEmoji
    src   "Clusters asking for emoji presentation (a pictograph that defaults to it, U+FE0F, a flag, a keycap, a skin tone, a\nZWJ sequence) try the colour faces among this font's faces first, as browsers do; off, every cluster takes the faces\nin order. A cluster in text presentation always tries the monochrome faces first."
    text  "请求以表情符号形式呈现的字符簇（默认如此呈现的图形符号、U+FE0F、旗帜、键帽、肤色、\nZWJ序列）会像浏览器那样优先尝试此字体各字型中的彩色字型；关闭后，每个字符簇按顺序取用各字型。\n以文本形式呈现的字符簇始终优先尝试单色字型。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender:bUseExternalFileOrEmbedInToUAsset {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender.h#DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender:bUseExternalFileOrEmbedInToUAsset
    src   "When in build, use external file or embed into uasset. But in editor, will always load from fontFilePath."
    text  "构建时，是否使用外部文件或嵌入到 uasset 中。但在编辑器中，始终从 fontFilePath 加载。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender:bUseRelativeFilePath {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender.h#DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender:bUseRelativeFilePath
    src   "Font file use relative path(relative to ProjectDir) or absolute path. After build your game, remember to copy your font file to target path, unless \"useExternalFileOrEmbedInToUAsset\" is false"
    text  "字体文件使用相对路径（相对于ProjectDir）或绝对路径。构建游戏后，请记得将字体文件复制到目标路径，除非“useExternalFileOrEmbedInToUAsset”（将字体嵌入资产）为false"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender:FallbackFontArray {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender.h#DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender:FallbackFontArray
    src   "The fallbacks of an asset saved before they had settings (FDreamGUIObjectVersion::FontFallbackEntries): moved into\nFallbacks, with default settings and in the same order, when the asset loads, and empty from then on. Not edited."
    text  "字体在回退项还没有设置时保存的资产的回退项（FDreamGUIObjectVersion::FontFallbackEntries）：资产加载时会以默认设置、按相同顺序移动到\nFallbacks中，此后一直为空。不可编辑。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender:Fallbacks {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender.h#DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender:Fallbacks
    src   "The faces tried for what this font's own face lacks. Entry i is face index i + 1. Which one draws a character is\ndecided by FDreamFontFaceResolver from each entry's ranges, cultures and preference, and the text's language."
    text  "当此字体自身的字型缺少所需字符时尝试的字型。第i项即字型索引i + 1。哪个字型绘制某个字符由\nFDreamFontFaceResolver根据每一项的范围、文化区域和优先级，以及文本的语言决定。"
    state machine
}

