DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender:Texture {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender.h#DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender:Texture
    src   "Texture of this font. Kept out of undo: it is the atlas the font made, not something edited, and an undo that put an\nolder pointer back left the live atlas rooted with nothing pointing at it."
    text  "此字体的纹理。不纳入撤销：它是字体生成的图集，而不是被编辑的内容；撤销把旧指针放回后，活动图集仍被根持有，\n却没有对象指向它。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender:TextureSizeType {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender.h#DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender:TextureSizeType
    src   "when packing char pixel into one single atlas texture, DreamUI will use this size to create a blank Texture2DArray, then insert char pixel."
    text  "当将字符像素打包到单个纹理图时，DreamUI 将使用此大小创建空白的 Texture2DArray，然后插入字符像素。"
