}

DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender:VerticalMetrics {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender.h#DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender:VerticalMetrics
    src   "Which of each face's own metrics the line box is built from, for this font's own face, its fallbacks and its style faces alike. LineHeightType then applies on top."
    text  "选择每个面的指标，用于构建行框，适用于此字体的面、其备用字体和其样式字体。然后，LineHeightType 会在此基础上进行应用。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFontFallback {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender.h#DreamUIFontFallback
    src   "One face a font falls back to for what its own face lacks: which font, for which characters and which languages, at\nwhat scale. Entry i of a font's Fallbacks is its face index i + 1, as it always was; the resolver\n(FDreamFontFaceResolver) decides the order they are tried in from these settings."
    text  "字体自身面缺失时回退使用的一个面：使用哪个字体、用于哪些字符和哪些语言、以什么\n缩放。字体Fallbacks的第i个条目始终是它的面索引i + 1；由解析器\n（FDreamFontFaceResolver）根据这些设置决定尝试顺序。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFontFallback:bPreferOverPrimary {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender.h#DreamUIFontFallback:bPreferOverPrimary
    src   "Win over the font's own face for the code points in Ranges when the text's language matches Cultures (Slate's sub-fonts)."
    text  "当文本的语言与文化相匹配时，覆盖主字体的代码点范围（Slate 的子字体）。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFontFallback:Cultures {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender.h#DreamUIFontFallback:Cultures
    src   "Cultures this face is meant for, semicolon-separated as Slate writes them (\"ja\", \"zh-Hans;zh-Hant\"); empty means any\nlanguage. Matched against the text's language (UDreamText::Language, a rich-text <lang=xx>) and the names it falls\nback to, so \"zh\" matches a Chinese text of any script."
}

DreamUIFontFallback:Font {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender.h#DreamUIFontFallback:Font
    src   "The fallback font. Its own face is used -- never its fallbacks or style faces in turn."
    text  "备用字体。使用其自身的面，而不是其自身的备用字体或样式字体。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFontFallback:Ranges {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender.h#DreamUIFontFallback:Ranges
    src   "Code point ranges, inclusive, this face may be used for, matched against a cluster's base; empty means every code point."
    text  "代码点范围，包含此字体的可用范围，与集群的基准进行匹配；为空表示所有代码点。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIFontFallback:Scale {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontData_FreeTypeRender.h#DreamUIFontFallback:Scale
    src   "CSS size-adjust: glyphs from this face are shaped and rasterized at the text's size times this, and the line box is\nmeasured at that size, so a face scaled up grows its lines (as in Chrome; Slate's ScalingFactor does not)."
    text  "CSS size-adjust：此面的字形按文本字号乘以该值进行整形和栅格化，行框也按该字号\n测量，因此放大后的面会使行高增大（与 Chrome 相同；Slate 的 ScalingFactor 则不会）。"
    state machine
}

